l/113385.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-22T01:26:40Z"},"body":"Adds the following tab sizing strategies:\r\n- Fit Content: Default behavior. Tabs are sized according to their content.\r\n- Uniform: Tabs are sized equally (uniformly), with the widest tab determining the size of all tabs.\r\n- Justify: Tabs are sized according to their content, but also expand to fill the tab bar width.\r\n- Expand: Tabs are sized equally, and expand to fill the tab bar width, if there is room for all tabs to be sized equally.\r\n\r\nA new \"Tab Sizing\" option is now available in both TabBar and TabContainer nodes. The default is \"Fit Content\".\r\n\r\nCloses [proposal #8397](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/8397).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113385/reactions","total_count":33,"+1":18,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":15,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113385/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}